## 4. API Design

### 4.1 Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/create-order` | Public | Create Razorpay order |
| POST | `/api/verify-payment` | Public | Verify payment + save donation |
| POST | `/api/webhook/razorpay` | Razorpay Signature | Handle payment events |
| GET | `/api/admin/donations` | Admin JWT | Fetch donor log |
| GET | `/api/admin/stats` | Admin JWT | Fetch dashboard stats |
| GET | `/api/health` | Public | Health check |

### 4.2 Request/Response Contracts

#### POST `/api/create-order`
```json
// Request
{
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "INR"
}

// Response — Success (200)
{
  "order_id": "order_xxxxxxxxx",
  "amount": 50000,
  "currency": "INR",
  "key_id": "rzp_test_xxxxxxxxx"
}

// Response — Error (400)
{
  "error": "Invalid donation amount. Must be between ₹1 and ₹1,00,000."
}
```

#### POST `/api/verify-payment`
```json
// Request
{
  "razorpay_order_id": "order_xxxxxxxxx",
  "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_xxxxxxxxx",
  "razorpay_signature": "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
  "donor_name": "Rahul Sharma",
  "donor_email": "rahul@example.com",
  "donor_phone": "9876543210",
  "amount": 500,
  "cause_id": "uuid-of-cause"
}

// Response — Success (200)
{
  "success": true,
  "donation_id": "uuid-of-donation",
  "message": "Donation recorded successfully"
}

// Response — Error (400)
{
  "error": "Payment verification failed. Invalid signature."
}
```

#### POST `/api/webhook/razorpay`
```json
// Request (from Razorpay)
{
  "event": "payment.captured",
  "payload": {
    "payment": {
      "entity": {
        "id": "pay_xxxxxxxxx",
        "order_id": "order_xxxxxxxxx",
        "amount": 50000,
        "currency": "INR",
        "status": "captured",
        "method": "upi"
      }
    }
  }
}

// Response — 200 OK (empty body)
```

#### GET `/api/admin/donations`
```json
// Query Parameters
// ?page=1&limit=20&search=rahul&date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-12-31

// Response — Success (200)
{
  "donations": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "donor_name": "Rahul Sharma",
      "donor_email": "rahul@example.com",
      "amount": 500,
      "currency": "INR",
      "status": "completed",
      "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_xxxxxxxxx",
      "payment_method": "upi",
      "created_at": "2026-06-10T10:30:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "total": 150,
  "page": 1,
  "limit": 20
}

// Response — Unauthorized (401)
{
  "error": "Unauthorized. Please log in."
}
```

#### GET `/api/admin/stats`
```json
// Response — Success (200)
{
  "total_donations": 150,
  "total_amount": 125000,
  "currency": "INR",
  "donations_today": 5,
  "amount_today": 3500
}
```

### 4.3 Authentication Requirements
- **Public endpoints**: No auth required (`create-order`, `verify-payment`)
- **Webhook**: Razorpay signature verification (see [security.mdc](./extended/security.mdc))
- **Admin endpoints**: Supabase JWT in `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header
- Session managed via HTTP-only cookie (Supabase Auth helpers)

