## 5. Edge Cases

### Payment Edge Cases
| # | Scenario | Expected Behavior |
|---|---|---|
| EC-01 | User pays but network drops before verify-payment | Webhook handles status update; user sees "verifying" message |
| EC-02 | Same order_id submitted twice for verification | Return existing donation (idempotent), don't duplicate |
| EC-03 | Webhook received before verify-payment call | Status updated to completed; verify-payment finds existing record |
| EC-04 | User donates ₹0 or negative amount | 400 error: "Invalid amount" |
| EC-05 | User donates > ₹1,00,000 | 400 error: "Amount exceeds maximum" |
| EC-06 | Razorpay API is down during order creation | 502 error: "Payment service unavailable. Try again." |
| EC-07 | User refreshes thank-you page | Shows cached donation data from query param |
| EC-08 | User accesses /thank-you directly without donation | Redirect to / or show generic thank-you |

### Admin Edge Cases
| # | Scenario | Expected Behavior |
|---|---|---|
| EC-09 | Admin session expires mid-use | Redirect to login with "Session expired" message |
| EC-10 | Admin searches for non-existent donor | Empty table with "No results found" message |
| EC-11 | Admin filters by future date | Empty results, no error |
| EC-12 | Multiple admins access simultaneously | No conflict — read-only operations |

### Data Edge Cases
| # | Scenario | Expected Behavior |
|---|---|---|
| EC-13 | Donor name contains special characters | Stored as-is, HTML-escaped on display |
| EC-14 | Donor email with uppercase letters | Stored lowercase, case-insensitive search |
| EC-15 | Very long donor name (> 255 chars) | Truncated at 255 characters |
| EC-16 | Emoji in donor name | Stored (UTF-8 supported), displayed correctly |

