## 7. Limitations

### Technical Limitations
- **Test Mode Only**: No real money processed; Razorpay test keys used
- **No Recurring Donations**: One-time donations only
- **No Receipt/Certificate Generation**: No 80G tax receipt auto-generation
- **No Email Notifications**: No automated thank-you email to donors
- **No Multi-Cause Support**: Single active cause at launch

### Business Limitations
- **Single NGO**: Platform serves one NGO only
- **Single Currency**: INR only
- **No Donor Accounts**: Donors don't create accounts or track history
- **No Fundraising Goals**: No campaign-level goal tracking (beyond basic progress)
- **No Social Sharing**: No integrated social media sharing (MVP)

### Scope Boundaries
- **In Scope**: See [Project_Scope.mdc](./Project_Scope.mdc)
- **Out of Scope**: See [Project_Boundaries.mdc](./Project_Boundaries.mdc)
- **Detailed Features**: See [features.mdc](./extended/features/features.mdc)

